    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@3834",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FLAVIUS.\nHence! home, you idle creatures, get you home.\nIs this a holiday? What, know you not,\nBeing mechanical, you ought not walk\nUpon a labouring day without the sign\nOf your profession? Speak, what trade art thou?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@3834/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@3834/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@3834/line-3",
          "start": 56,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@3834/line-4",
          "start": 95,
          "end": 131,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@3834/line-5",
          "start": 132,
          "end": 169,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@3834/line-6",
          "start": 170,
          "end": 217,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3014231,
        "end": 3014498,
        "line": 109097,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@3834",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FLAVIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4105",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CARPENTER.\nWhy, sir, a carpenter.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4105/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4105/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 33,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3014502,
        "end": 3014565,
        "line": 109106,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4105",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CARPENTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4172",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARULLUS.\nWhere is thy leather apron and thy rule?\nWhat dost thou with thy best apparel on?\nYou, sir, what trade are you?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4172/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4172/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4172/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4172/line-4",
          "start": 92,
          "end": 121,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3014569,
        "end": 3014730,
        "line": 109111,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4172",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARULLUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4337",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COBBLER.\nTruly, sir, in respect of a fine workman, I am but, as you would say, a cobbler.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4337/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4337/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 89,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3014734,
        "end": 3014854,
        "line": 109118,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4337",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COBBLER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4461",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARULLUS.\nBut what trade art thou? Answer me directly.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4461/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4461/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3014858,
        "end": 3014942,
        "line": 109124,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4461",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARULLUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4549",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COBBLER.\nA trade, sir, that I hope I may use with a safe conscience, which is indeed, sir, a mender of bad soles.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4549/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4549/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 113,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3014946,
        "end": 3015090,
        "line": 109129,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4549",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COBBLER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4697",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARULLUS.\nWhat trade, thou knave? Thou naughty knave, what trade?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4697/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4697/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 65,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3015094,
        "end": 3015189,
        "line": 109135,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4697",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARULLUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4796",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COBBLER.\nNay, I beseech you, sir, be not out with me; yet, if you be out, sir, I can mend you.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4796/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4796/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3015193,
        "end": 3015318,
        "line": 109140,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4796",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COBBLER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4925",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARULLUS.\nWhat mean’st thou by that? Mend me, thou saucy fellow!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4925/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@4925/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 64,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3015322,
        "end": 3015416,
        "line": 109146,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@4925",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARULLUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5023",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COBBLER.\nWhy, sir, cobble you.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5023/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5023/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 30,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3015420,
        "end": 3015480,
        "line": 109151,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@5023",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COBBLER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5087",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FLAVIUS.\nThou art a cobbler, art thou?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5087/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5087/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 38,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3015484,
        "end": 3015552,
        "line": 109156,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@5087",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FLAVIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5159",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COBBLER.\nTruly, sir, all that I live by is with the awl; I meddle with no tradesman’s matters, nor women’s matters, but withal I am indeed, sir, a surgeon to old shoes: when they are in great danger, I recover them. As proper men as ever trod upon neat’s leather have gone upon my handiwork.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5159/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5159/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 291,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3015556,
        "end": 3015880,
        "line": 109161,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@5159",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COBBLER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5487",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FLAVIUS.\nBut wherefore art not in thy shop today?\nWhy dost thou lead these men about the streets?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5487/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5487/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5487/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 97,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3015884,
        "end": 3016016,
        "line": 109169,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@5487",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FLAVIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5623",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COBBLER.\nTruly, sir, to wear out their shoes, to get myself into more work. But indeed, sir, we make holiday to see Caesar, and to rejoice in his triumph.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5623/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5623/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 154,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3016020,
        "end": 3016205,
        "line": 109175,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap17/p@5623",
        "anchor": "sceneI_17.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COBBLER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARULLUS.\nWherefore rejoice? What conquest brings he home?\nWhat tributaries follow him to Rome,\nTo grace in captive bonds his chariot wheels?\nYou blocks, you stones, you worse than senseless things!\nO you hard hearts, you cruel men of Rome,\nKnew you not Pompey? Many a time and oft\nHave you climb’d up to walls and battlements,\nTo towers and windows, yea, to chimney tops,\nYour infants in your arms, and there have sat\nThe livelong day with patient expectation,\nTo see great Pompey pass the streets of Rome.\nAnd when you saw his chariot but appear,\nHave you not made an universal shout,\nThat Tiber trembled underneath her banks\nTo hear the replication of your sounds\nMade in her concave shores?\nAnd do you now put on your best attire?\nAnd do you now cull out a holiday?\nAnd do you now strew flowers in his way,\nThat comes in triumph over Pompey’s blood?\nBe gone!\nRun to your houses, fall upon your knees,\nPray to the gods to intermit the plague\nThat needs must light on this ingratitude.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 95,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-4",
          "start": 96,
          "end": 141,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-5",
          "start": 142,
          "end": 198,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-6",
          "start": 199,
          "end": 240,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-7",
          "start": 241,
          "end": 281,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-8",
          "start": 282,
          "end": 327,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "julius-caesar/sceneI_17.1/p@5812/line-9",
          "start": 328,
          "end": 372,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
